f-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Wilkinson County came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 35 of 75 years on record since 1951. The middle ran 42% of normal in September to October 2025 and 38% of normal in October to November 2025. All 7 grids had their driest year in 1954.</p>"}
